ind":"announcement","title":"SnorQ v0.1.1 demo AVAILABLE NOW!","summary":"Hi everyone! Demo version 0.1.1 is now live! This update focuses on balancing and bug fixes. Patch Notes 0.1.1 – DemoContent: Added a music track for defeated bosses Added missing sounds for some enemies and companions Improved font readability Added a notification for the Items menu Updated the item list Improved the stamina bar Gameplay Balancing: Rebalanced some enemies and bosses Rebalanced companions Adjusted difficulty in some levels Bug Fixes: Fixed bugs and menu layering issues on PC Fix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T20:57:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679271","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4802220-1846018067939347","game_id":"steam-4802220","kind":"update","title":"FIRST UPDATE!","summary":"Hi community,the demo is getting an update! Thank you all!Version 0.1.1 brings fixes, tweaks and a few improvements to make your adventure even more enjoyable.The update will be released on October 16, 2026.Check out all the changes below:_______________________Patch Notes Demo 0.1.1Content:Added a music track for defeated bossesAdded missing sounds for some enemies and companionsImproved font readabilityAdded a notification for the Items menuGameplay Balancing:Rebalanced some enemies and bosses","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T20:41:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939347","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4802220-1836506165572747","game_id":"steam-4802220","kind":"announcement","title":"SnorQ will be participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest!!","summary":"Hi everyone!! We’ll be participating in the upcoming Steam Next Fest on October 19th with SnorQ. You’ll be able to play the demo, which is coming out soon. Stay tuned for updates on the demo's release, and add SnorQ to your wishlist to support our work! If you’re curious to see what we’re working on, follow our Instagram page! We post updates about SnorQ every day! Here is the link to our Instagram page: Thank you for support us!! ːsteamhappyː ːsteamthumbsupː ːsteamthisː","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T17:13:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165572747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4802220-1835871199309227","game_id":"steam-4802220","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for your support!!","summary":"We, at the LumisepiA team, want to thank you for visiting our game page! Add SnorQ to your wishlist to support us and stay update on the demo and game release date!!If you'd like to check out our work and stay updated on development, you can follow us on Instagram:https://www.instagram.com/lumisepia?igsh=cmF0a29vdXlsZTR0We regularly share new behind the scenes videos. Thak you for your support!! ːsteamhappyː ːsteamthumbsupː","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T12:15:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199309227","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4802220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4802220":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4802220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04: